{
  "Name": "WordPress Hash Form Plugin RCE",
  "Description": "The Hash Form \u2013 Drag & Drop Form Builder plugin for WordPress suffers from a critical vulnerability due to missing file type validation in the file_upload_action function. This vulnerability exists in all versions up to and including 1.1.0. Unauthenticated attackers can exploit this flaw to upload arbitrary files, including PHP scripts, to the server, potentially allowing for remote code execution on the affected WordPress site. This module targets multiple platforms by adapting payload delivery and execution based on the server environment.",
